{
  "about": "Rules shared by the Rust commands (src-tauri/src/todo.rs) and the browser mock (src/lib/ipc/mock-todo.test.ts). See ADR 0009. steps run in order. Tasks and Lists are referenced by the index of the n-th successfully created one (`task`, `list`; a literal string is used as an id, null is the Inbox). ops: create{title,list?}, complete, reopen, move{task,list}, list_create{name}, list_rename{list,name}, list_emoji{list,emoji}, list_delete{list,choice: 'delete'|'inbox'|{list: n}} (the n-th deletion is kept for list_restore{deletion}). results: 'ok' or the error code of each step. inbox: titles in the Inbox. lists: List names in order. emojis: their emoji. counts: [Inbox open count, then each List's]. all: the All view as [[group name, [titles]]] (Inbox first, empty groups left out). expect lists just the keys to check.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "rule": "title.blank",
      "name": "an empty title is rejected",
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "create",
          "title": ""
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "results": ["validation"],
        "inbox": []
      }
    },
    {
      "rule": "title.blank",
      "name": "whitespace only is rejected",
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "create",
          "title": "  \t "
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "results": ["validation"],
        "inbox": []
      }
    },
    {
      "rule": "title.trim",
      "name": "a title is stored trimmed",
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "create",
          "title": "  Buy oat milk  "
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "results": ["ok"],
        "inbox": ["Buy oat milk"]
      }
    },
    {
      "rule": "title.single_line",
      "name": "a line break is rejected",
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "create",
          "title": "one\ntwo"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "results": ["validation"],
        "inbox": []
      }
    },
    {
      "rule": "title.single_line",
      "name": "a carriage return is rejected",
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "create",
          "title": "one\r\ntwo"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "results": ["validation"],
        "inbox": []
      }
    },
    {
